exports[`answer page > gives the same facts as Markdown: h1, lead, tables, sources, then the citation 1`] = `
"# Is Monday 28 December 2026 a CHAPS business day?

No: Monday 28 December 2026 is not a CHAPS business day, because CHAPS is closed for Boxing Day (substitute day), according to GOV.UK; CHAPS reopens on Tuesday 29 December 2026 at 06:00 Europe/London (Zeitwide release 2026.10.28.1).

## 28 days of CHAPS around Mon 28 Dec 2026

CHAPS, Thu 24 Dec 2026 to Mon 4 Jan 2027

| Date | CHAPS |
| --- | --- |
| [Thu 24 Dec 2026](https://zeitwide.example/calendars/GB-CHAPS/2026-12-24) | CHAPS open Thu 24 Dec 2026 |
| [Fri 25 Dec 2026](https://zeitwide.example/calendars/GB-CHAPS/2026-12-25) | CHAPS closed Fri 25 Dec 2026: Christmas Day |
| [Sat 26 Dec 2026](https://zeitwide.example/calendars/GB-CHAPS/2026-12-26) | CHAPS closed for the weekend Sat 26 Dec 2026 |
| [Sun 27 Dec 2026](https://zeitwide.example/calendars/GB-CHAPS/2026-12-27) | CHAPS closed for the weekend Sun 27 Dec 2026 |
| [Mon 28 Dec 2026](https://zeitwide.example/calendars/GB-CHAPS/2026-12-28) | CHAPS closed Mon 28 Dec 2026: Boxing Day (substitute day) (this date) |
| [Tue 29 Dec 2026](https://zeitwide.example/calendars/GB-CHAPS/2026-12-29) | CHAPS open Tue 29 Dec 2026 |
| [Wed 30 Dec 2026](https://zeitwide.example/calendars/GB-CHAPS/2026-12-30) | CHAPS open Wed 30 Dec 2026 |
| [Thu 31 Dec 2026](https://zeitwide.example/calendars/GB-CHAPS/2026-12-31) | CHAPS open Thu 31 Dec 2026 |
| [Fri 1 Jan 2027](https://zeitwide.example/calendars/GB-CHAPS/2027-01-01) | CHAPS closed Fri 1 Jan 2027: New Year's Day |
| [Sat 2 Jan 2027](https://zeitwide.example/calendars/GB-CHAPS/2027-01-02) | CHAPS closed for the weekend Sat 2 Jan 2027 |
| [Sun 3 Jan 2027](https://zeitwide.example/calendars/GB-CHAPS/2027-01-03) | CHAPS closed for the weekend Sun 3 Jan 2027 |
| [Mon 4 Jan 2027](https://zeitwide.example/calendars/GB-CHAPS/2027-01-04) | CHAPS open Mon 4 Jan 2027 |

## Other calendars on Mon 28 Dec 2026

Monday 28 December 2026 on 3 other calendars

| Calendar | Status | Why |
| --- | --- | --- |
| T2 (EU-T2) | [T2 open Mon 28 Dec 2026](https://zeitwide.example/calendars/EU-T2/2026-12-28) | Business day |
| Fedwire Funds (US-FEDWIRE) | No data | Outside this calendar's sources |
| FedNow (US-FEDNOW) | [FedNow open Mon 28 Dec 2026](https://zeitwide.example/calendars/US-FEDNOW/2026-12-28) | Boxing Day (substitute day) |

## Questions people ask

**When does CHAPS reopen after Monday 28 December 2026?**
CHAPS reopens on Tuesday 29 December 2026 at 06:00 Europe/London.

**What are CHAPS's operating hours?**
CHAPS is open from 06:00 to 18:00 Europe/London on business days.

**Where does this answer come from?**
GOV.UK, last read 31 Oct 2026, 06:10 UTC. The operator published this date. It is in Zeitwide release 2026.10.28.1.

## Sources

- GOV.UK: <https://www.gov.uk/bank-holidays> (Read 31 Oct 2026, 06:10 UTC)

Zeitwide release 2026.10.28.1.

## Cite

Zeitwide (2026). GB-CHAPS on 2026-12-28. Release 2026.10.28.1. https://zeitwide.example/calendars/GB-CHAPS/2026-12-28
"
`;

