| [CHAPS closed Mon 28 Dec 2026: Boxing Day (substitute day)](https://zeitwide.example/calendars/GB-CHAPS/2026-12-28) | Boxing Day (substitute day) | Published | [CHAPS reopens Tue 29 Dec 2026](https://zeitwide.example/calendars/GB-CHAPS/2026-12-29) | GOV.UK |
| [CHAPS closed Fri 1 Jan 2027: New Year's Day](https://zeitwide.example/calendars/GB-CHAPS/2027-01-01) | New Year's Day | Published | [CHAPS reopens Tue 29 Dec 2026](https://zeitwide.example/calendars/GB-CHAPS/2026-12-29) | GOV.UK |

